Backport: recontextualized for upstream 2.13.9; existing ABI retained.
Uses Debian's fprintf debug-call adaptation. The newer testcatalog-only API and harness are not transplanted; 2.13.9 has no catalog resolve cache, so the later cache-reset patch does not apply.

